The agent engine architecture (session loop, tools, permissions, plugins,
skills, memory, prune, subagents, store, headless mode) is adapted from
shiro-neko by zakirkun, licensed under the MIT License:
  https://github.com/zakirkun/shiro-neko

Adaptations for windcode: Bun -> Node.js runtime port (src/fsx.ts shim),
multi-provider registry with OpenCode Zen as the free default provider,
Indonesian onboarding UX, readline REPL instead of the ink TUI, and
curl-based installer.
